<p dir="ltr">Hey {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</p>

<p dir="ltr">Just sending some insight into a couple programs here at EverQuote.</p>

<p dir="ltr">Our Core and AGP programs are highly data-driven, which means that we use advanced analytics to optimize your lead generation and help you close more deals.We measure your return on investment (ROI), cost per bind, cost per acquisition, and close rate, and provide you with regular reviews so that you can see how your business is doing. .</p>

<p dir="ltr">In some cases, we also offer producer training to help you optimize your business experience. This training can be a valuable asset to help you get the most out of our AGP program and drive your business forward.<br />
<br />
I understand that you may have some questions about these programs, and I am more than happy to answer any queries you may have.Please feel free to reply to this email, call me at {{{Sender.Phone}}} or schedule some time on my calendar (link below). Thank you for your continued business with EverQuote, and I look forward to hearing back from you.</p>

<p dir="ltr">Best regards,</p>

